00:53:10,000 --> 00:53:16,000
Breakthrough is a 2019 American Christian drama film directed by
Roxann Dawson in her feature film directorial debut.

12
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
The film was written by Grant Nieporte, based on the Christian book The Impossible,
an account of true events written by Joyce Smith with Ginger Kolbaba.

13
01:02:50,000 --> 01:02:56,000
It stars Chrissy Metz, Josh Lucas, Topher Grace, Mike
Colter, Marcel Ruiz and Dennis Haysbert.

14
01:07:40,000 --> 01:07:46,000
Stephen Curry and Samuel Rodriguez are executive producers.

15
01:12:30,000 --> 01:12:36,000
The film tells the story of a St.

