01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:26,000
Louis teenager who slipped through an icy lake on January 19, 2015, and was
underwater for 15 minutes before resuscitative efforts were started.

17
01:22:10,000 --> 01:22:16,000
Although he was rescued, he remains in a coma, and his family
must rely on their faith to get through the ordeal.

